          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላሉም ፡ ተመልሰው ፡ በኦሪት ፡ መኖ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርን ፡ ወደዋልና ፡ እንዘ ፡ ኢትትመየጡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ ጌጋይ ፡ አላት ፡ ኦሪትን ፡ ትለፍ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካለ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ቢይዝዋት ፡ ፍዳን ፡ የምታመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣባቸው ፡ ስለ ፡ ሆነ ። አንድም ። ለባላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገር ፡ ይጽፋል ፡ ብሎ ፡ ባለማወቅ ፡ ትወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዷት ፡ ወደ ፡ ነበረ ፡ ወደ ፡ ጣዖት ፡ ሳት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መለሱ ፡ ጌጋይ ፡ የተመቸ ፡ ሮሜ ፡ ፲፪ ፥ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፭ ፤ ⟪ወባሕቱ ፡ በከመ ፡ ዘጸውዐክሙ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እቱ ፡ ወአንትሙኒ ፡ ኩኑ ፡ ቅዱሳነ ፡ በኵሉ ፡ ግዕዝ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገር ፡ ግን ፡ ንዑ ፡ ትልዉኒ ፡ ብሎ ፡ በሃይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማኖት ፡ የጠራችሁ ፡ እሱ ፡ ንጹሕ ፡ እንደ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆነ ፡ እናንተም ፡ በሥራችሁ ፡ ሁሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጹሐን ፡ ሁኑ ፡ ሉቃ ፡ ፩ ፥ ፸፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፲፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ጽሑፍ ፡ ዘይብል ፡ ኩኑ ፡ ቅዱሳነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስመ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ አነ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ፡ ንጹሕ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆንሁ ፡ ንጹሐን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁኑ ፡ የሚል ፡ ጽሑፍ ፡ አለና ፡ ሐተታ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ የሚል ፡ ወዴት ፡ አለ ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ኢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትብልዑ፡ ዘክልኤ ፡ ጥረሲሁ ፡ ወዘጽሩቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰኰናሁ ፡ ያለውን ፡ ለውጦ ፡ አነበበው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ አለ ። አንድም ፡ ንዑ ፡ ትልዉኒ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ፡ በሃይማኖት ፡ የጠራችሁ ፡ እሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልዩ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ እናንተም ፡ በሥራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችሁ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ልዩ ፡ ሁኑ ፡ እንጅ ፡ እኔ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልዩ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆንሁ ፡ ልዩ ፡ ሁኑ ፡ የሚል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽሑፍ ፡ አለና። ሐተታ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ የሚል፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወዴት ፡ አለ ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ቀድስ ፡ ሊተ ፡ ሌዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውያነ ፡ ያለውን ፡ ለውጦ ፡ አነበበው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ አለ ፡ ዘሌዋ ፡ ፲፩ ፥ ፵፬ ። መዝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፸፩ ፥ ፳፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፲፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፯ ፤ ⟪ወእመሰ ፡ ለአብ ፡ ትጼውዕዎ ፡ ለዘይኴንን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዘ ፡ ገጸ ፡ ኢይነሥእ ፡ በበምግባሪሁ ፡ ለለአሐዱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለና ፡ ለ ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን ፡ ነው ፡ ለአብ ፡ ለዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኴንን ፡ ፊት ፡ አይቶ ፡ ሳይደላ ፡ ላንዱ ፡ ላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዱም ፡ እያንዳንዱም ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ሥራው ፡ እንደ ፡ ሥራው ፡ የሚፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራርድ ፡ አብን ፡ የምትለምኑት ፡ ከሆነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እንዘ ፡ ትፈርሁ ፡ በኵሉ ፡ መዋዕለ ፡ ሕይወትክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባለ ፡ ዘመናችሁ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እየፈራችሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በዘአመንክሙ ፡ ሑሩ ፡ ባቲ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባመናችሁበት ፡ እምነት ፡ ጸንታችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ ፊት ፡ ገሥግሡ ፡ አለ ፡ የትሩፋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥራ ፡ ሥሩ ፡ ጨምሩበት ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ከሆነ ፡ እየፈራችሁ ፡ ይሁን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወበዘአመንክሙ ፡ ባመናችሁበትም ፡ እም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነት ፡ ጸንታችሁ ፡ ኑሩ ። (ጥቅ) ፡ ለምንት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሐውር ፡ ወልደ ፡ ብእሲት ፡ ምስለ ፡ ብሉ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የ ፡ መዋዕል ፡ ወእለ ፡ አምሠጡ፡ የሐውሩ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባቲ ፡ እንዲል ፡ የሐዋ ፡ ፲፯ ፥ ፴፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፰ ፤ ⟪እንዘ ፡ ተአምሩ ፡ ከመ ፡ አኮ ፡ በዘይማስን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሩር ፡ ወወርቅ ፡ ዘተቤዘውክሙ ፡ እምውስተ ፡ ዘኢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይበቍዕ ፡ ምግባሪክሙ ፡ ዘተመጠውክሙ ፡ እምአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዊክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካባቶቻችሁ ፡ ካገኛችሁት ፡ ከማይረባ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከማይጠቅም ፡ ሥራችሁ ፡ የተቤዣችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሚለወጥ ፡ በወርቅ ፡ በብር ፡ እንዳይደለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አውቃችሁ ። ሐተታ ፡ ብርን ፡ ሲያይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ እንጅ ፡ ወርቅስ ፡ አይዝግም ። አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለወጥም ፡ ይህስ ፡ ይዝጋልና ፡ አያሳት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትም ። ሐተታ ፡ ኃጢአትን ፡ ክህደትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
